  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><div class=\"grid-cols-1 grid gap-2.5 [&amp;_>_*]:min-w-0 !gap-3.5\" id=\"isPasted\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5\" level=\"2\">Brand Introduction</h2><p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Grillvia is a premium outdoor living and pool specialist that transforms outdoor spaces with high-quality, functional products. The brand focuses on outdoor living and pool areas, offering stylish, functional pieces ranging from patios to gardens. Their mission is to help customers create the perfect outdoor escape just steps from their door, bringing garden dreams to life with comprehensive outdoor solutions.</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5\" level=\"2\">Product Description</h2><p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Grillvia offers high-quality outdoor living products including grills, patio furniture, in-pool seating, garden accessories, fire pits, and umbrellas. Their extensive product range covers:</p><ul class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7\" depth=\"0\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"0\"><strong>Grills</strong>: Premium outdoor cooking equipment for all skill levels</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"1\"><strong>Patio Furniture</strong>: Stylish and durable outdoor seating and dining sets</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"2\"><strong>In-Pool Seating</strong>: Specialized pool furniture for ultimate relaxation</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"3\"><strong>Fire Pits</strong>: Outdoor heating and ambiance solutions</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"4\"><strong>Garden Accessories</strong>: Comprehensive outdoor décor and functional items</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"5\"><strong>Pool Essentials</strong>: Complete pool area furnishing solutions</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"6\"><strong>Umbrellas</strong>: Weather protection and shade solutions</li></ul><p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">The brand regularly adds new arrivals and focuses on premium products from trusted manufacturers with comprehensive warranties.</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5\" level=\"2\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</h2><p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Grillvia's competitive advantages include:</p><ol class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7\" depth=\"0\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"0\"><strong>Free Shipping &amp; No Sales Tax</strong>: Free shipping and no sales tax on all products</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"1\"><strong>Best Price Guarantee</strong>: Price matching policy - if you find a product listed cheaper online, they will price match</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"2\"><strong>Expert Customer Service</strong>: 24/7 chat, email, and customer success team support</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"3\"><strong>Easy Returns</strong>: 30-day hassle-free returns with customer satisfaction priority</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"4\"><strong>Secure Checkout</strong>: 100% secure and encrypted checkout process</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"5\"><strong>Quality Guarantee</strong>: Premium products from trusted brands with comprehensive warranties</li></ol><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5\" level=\"2\">Payment Terms</h2><p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Based on industry standards for similar outdoor living retailers, typical affiliate payment terms would include:</p><ul class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7\" depth=\"0\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" index=\"0\">Commission 